      "comment": "Dynamic-discovery adapter for Aave Umbrella stake tokens. The full stake-token set (stkwaEthUSDC.v1, stkwaEthUSDT.v1, stkwaEthWETH.v1, stkGHO.v1 today) is enumerated at runtime via RewardsController.getAllAssets(); each stake token's bare reserve is resolved by walking its ERC4626 asset() chain. The only address pinned in this adapter is the RewardsController above, passed via constructor and treated as the protocol's trust anchor. New stake tokens added by Aave governance are picked up automatically as long as their bare reserve is registered with NAVCalculator. See docs/decisions/0006-aave-umbrella-balance-oracle.md."
